@baseUrl = http://localhost:5244
@courseId = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@topicId = 20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@lessonId = 30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@email = student@example.test
@password = Development123!

### Get CSRF token; Rider preserves response cookies.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

> {% client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token); %}

### Register (run once, or change the example email).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}","displayName":"Студент"}

### Login.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Refresh CSRF after login.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

> {% client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token); %}

### My profile.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me

### Published courses.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses

### Topics.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{courseId}}/topics

### Topic details.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics/{{topicId}}

### Lesson.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lessons/{{lessonId}}

### Mark as read (repeat returns the same timestamp).
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/lessons/{{lessonId}}/completion
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{}

### Logout; get a new token before logging in again.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{}

### Readiness.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
